            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all 32 manifest paths from a risk lens.",
              "The functional change narrows contract injection scope: the sdd-tasks, sdd-apply and sdd-design names leave applies_to_phases in the three contracts and AGENT_NAMES in engine/pipkg/labdrian-gate.ts. The agents that still get a contract are shaper and builder. This reduces the injection surface and adds no input handling, privilege, secret or network path.",
