                "claim": "The gate-task golden cases still send sdd-apply and sdd-tasks subagent types with the anti-generic-design contract, and the outputs are now the {} no-op. The cases read as if they exercise injection, but they only show the removal. A reader scanning the golden sees an injection command whose result is empty, with no nearby note that this is intentional. Moving these cases to builder, as main_test.go did, would keep the golden's purpose clear.",
